# The voices turned off on the language page (fixtures/sound: English
# texts and voices). Left from English gives None, LanguageCD staying at
# 0, and on leaving the page writes LanguageCD: None to lba.cfg, where
# the Classic, comparing the languages alone, writes nothing.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
key Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Down Down Left
sleep 2
shot none
key Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Up Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot main
